                        "email": "alex.ts.wang@fii-foxconn.com",
                        "username": "Alex-TS-Wang"
                    },
                    "message": "Using an uppercase \"E\" does cause issues, so we changed it to a lowercase \"e\". The Nvidia commit indeed comes from the Nvidia fork."
